  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A sense of dread settles upon the one who dons this plate, as if the metal itself demands a dark purpose. It turns the body into a fortress against the strike of blade or mace, while a shroud of gloom clings to the movements of its owner."
